# am/finitediff's LargerRectangle example (github/am_finitedifference,
# examples/am_finitediff/LargerRectangle) on the conduction source: its
# 21-layer raster path read with `laser_path file`. Layer 1 rasters along
# x, layer 2 along y, 50 um hatch. The original jumps 2e-7 s between
# rasters, which piles heat up raster after raster (melt depth 65 -> 110 um
# across a layer); here each jump waits 5 ms (65 -> 75 um), covered by RKL2
# super-steps (`sts 128`). As in the
# original, the 30-site box holds the first two layers (`layers 2`); a
# taller box and a longer run take more.
# Path in lattice units: scale by dx, laser plane half a site above the
# top site of each layer. One process, ~0.29 s with the pauses.
app_style        additive/texture/kk 1000000 5e-6 5e-6 2
seed             56789
dimension        3
lattice          sc/26n 1.0
region           box block 0 360 0 250 0 30
boundary         n n n
create_box       box
create_sites     box
set site range 1 1000000
region           substrate block 0 360 0 250 0 18.5
set i2 value 3 region substrate
region           plate block -200 560 -200 450 -200 18.5
set i1 value 42 region substrate
set d1 value 1.0 region substrate
set d2 value 0.0 region substrate
set d3 value 0.0 region substrate
set d4 value 0.0 region substrate
sector           yes
sweep            color
diag_style       array d6 sum d6 max
temperature      0.0
misorientation_target random_rotation
liquidus         1708
solidus          1675
solid_front_vel  4 1.091e-5 -2.034e-4 2.74e-3 1.151e-4
nucleation_density      1e14
critical_undercooling   5
undercooling_deviation  3
mean_nuclei_volume      8.4375e-16
nuclei_volume_deviation 1.5625e-17

# 150 W absorbed, k 30, rho 5706 (alpha = k/(rho cp0)), T0 300 K. Spot sigma
# 42 um (x, y) / 70 um (z) in am/finitediff's exp(-r^2/2 sigma^2), i.e.
# s = sqrt(2) sigma here: re-tuned with the energy-conserving am/finitediff
# (its 137d5948) to the original ThinWall pool, ~100 um wide x 60 um deep.
setup_temperature_source conduction 150.0 1.0 13.8 3.6166e-6 300.0 483.0 59.4e-6 59.4e-6 99.0e-6 &
    k_powder 0.3 k_table 6 300 13.8 600 20.0 900 24.8 1200 28.4 1500 30.6 1675 31.3 &
    cp_table 7 300 483 473 528 873 595 1073 611 1253 624 1675 714 1708 847 &
    latent 2.9e5 convection 25 300 emissivity 0.4 &
    margin 0.5e-3 0.5e-3 0.5e-3 0.5e-3 plate 0.5e-3 part plate far_bc fixed sts 128

laser_path file large_rectangle.path speed 1.4 scale 5e-6 shift 0 0 2.5e-6 &
    jump_time 5e-3 layers 2
stats            1e-3
dump             1 text 0.3 dump.large_rectangle.* id i1 i2 x y z
dump_modify      1 thresh i2 > 2
run              0.3
